   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🔬 Eksperimen Gabungan 1 & 2: Repeated LOPO-CV (10x Uji Konsistensi)\n",
    "**Kelompok Peneliti**: Kelompok A01 — RPL A (Magister Teknik Informatika ITS)  \n",
    "**Tujuan Eksperimen**: Menguji kestabilan, variansi stokastik, dan konsistensi empiris lintas **10 independent random seeds** pada 72 pipeline gabungan (C1/C2/C3 × S1/S2/S3 × B1/B2/B3/B4 × M1/M2).  \n",
    "**Daftar Seeds Baku (10x)**: `[42, 100, 2024, 777, 999, 123, 456, 789, 2025, 2026]`  \n",
    "**Protokol Validasi**: Leave-One-Project-Out Cross-Validation (Zero Data Leakage)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup Lingkungan & Import Modul Eksperimen"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "# Hubungkan ke direktori src\n",
    "src_dir = str(Path(\"../src\").resolve())\n",
    "if src_dir not in sys.path:\n",
    "    sys.path.append(src_dir)\n",
    "\n",
    "from data_loader import load_dataset\n",
    "from pipeline_builder import get_pipeline_specs\n",
    "from repeated_lopo_runner import run_repeated_lopo_experiments, DEFAULT_SEEDS_10\n",
    "from consistency_analyzer import analyze_pipeline_consistency\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"[OK] 10 Baku Random Seeds: {DEFAULT_SEEDS_10}\")\n",
    "all_specs = get_pipeline_specs()\n",
    "print(f\"[OK] Total Pipeline Specs Terdefinisi: {len(all_specs)} Pipelines\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Pilihan Mode Eksekusi Uji Konsistensi (Repeated LOPO-CV)\n",
    "- **Pilihan A: Smoke Test Cepat**: 3 pipelines (1 dari tiap C1, C2, C3) pada 2 seeds & 2 folds.\n",
    "- **Pilihan B: Top 12 Pipelines (Rekomendasi Cepat & Akurat)**: Menguji top 4 pipelines dari masing-masing C1, C2, dan C3 lintas 10 random seeds.\n",
    "- **Pilihan C: Full 72 Pipelines**: Menguji seluruh 72 pipeline faktorial lintas 10 seeds."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Pilihan A: Mode Cepat / Smoke Test (3 Pipelines C1/C2/C3, 2 Seeds)\n",
    "results_quick = run_repeated_lopo_experiments(\n",
    "    pipelines=[all_specs[0], all_specs[24], all_specs[48]],\n",
    "    seeds=DEFAULT_SEEDS_10[:2],\n",
    "    output_dir=\"../results_quick_test\",\n",
    "    use_gpu=True,\n",
    "    quick_test=True\n",
    ")\n",
    "display(results_quick[\"all_runs\"].head())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Pilihan B: Eksekusi Top 12 Pipelines Gabungan Lintas 10 Random Seeds\n",
    "top_pipeline_ids = [\n",
    "    \"P13_C1_S2_B3_M1\", \"P14_C1_S2_B3_M2\", \"P05_C1_S1_B3_M1\", \"P06_C1_S1_B3_M2\",\n",
    "    \"P37_C2_S2_B3_M1\", \"P38_C2_S2_B3_M2\", \"P45_C2_S3_B3_M1\", \"P46_C2_S3_B3_M2\",\n",
    "    \"P61_C3_S2_B3_M1\", \"P62_C3_S2_B3_M2\", \"P53_C3_S1_B3_M1\", \"P54_C3_S1_B3_M2\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "selected_pipelines = [p for p in all_specs if p[\"pipeline_id\"] in top_pipeline_ids]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Memulai repeated evaluation untuk {len(selected_pipelines)} top pipelines lintas 10 seeds...\")\n",
    "results_10x = run_repeated_lopo_experiments(\n",
    "    pipelines=selected_pipelines,\n",
    "    seeds=DEFAULT_SEEDS_10,\n",
    "    output_dir=\"../results\",\n",
    "    use_gpu=True\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Analisis Konsistensi & Tabel Stabilitas Empiris\n",
    "Menghitung Mean ($\mu$), Standar Deviasi ($\sigma$), Coefficient of Variation ($CV = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\mu} \\times 100\\%$), serta rentang nilai (Min-Max) dan 95% Confidence Interval."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df_cons = analyze_pipeline_consistency(\n",
    "    all_runs_csv=\"../results/all_seed_pipeline_runs.csv\",\n",
    "    output_dir=\"../results\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "cols_show = [\n",
    "    \"Pipeline_ID\", \"Cleaning\", \"Scaling\", \"Imbalance\", \"Model\", \"Num_Seeds\",\n",
    "    \"Mean_F1_Mean\", \"Mean_F1_Std\", \"Mean_F1_CV_%\", \"Mean_F1_CI95\",\n",
    "    \"Mean_Recall_Mean\", \"Mean_Precision_Mean\", \"Mean_PR_AUC_Mean\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "display(df_cons[[c for c in cols_show if c in df_cons.columns]].head(12))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Visualisasi Distribusi F1-Score Lintas 10 Repetisi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df_runs = pd.read_csv(\"../results/all_seed_pipeline_runs.csv\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(14, 6))\n",
    "sns.boxplot(data=df_runs, x=\"Pipeline_ID\", y=\"Mean_F1\", hue=\"Cleaning\", palette={\"C1\": \"#3498db\", \"C2\": \"#e74c3c\", \"C3\": \"#2ecc71\"})\n",
    "plt.xticks(rotation=45, ha=\"right\")\n",
    "plt.title(\"Distribusi F1-Score Lintas 10 Repetisi Seeds: Komparasi Tri-Paradigma Cleaning\", fontsize=13, fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"Mean F1-Score\")\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"Pipeline ID\")\n",
    "plt.grid(True, linestyle=\"--\", alpha=0.5)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  }
 ],
